    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insŭlārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A tenant of an</i> insula (post-Aug.),
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 95</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dig. 1, 15,
				4</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">CERDO INSVLAR.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 2926</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A slave who had charge of an</i> insula, <i>and collected the rents</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 50,
				16, 203</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 8,
				16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 3, 5
				al.</span></i></div>
